{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to a world where temptation lives between the lines of art.<br><strong>Hentai Haruko</strong> is not just a puzzle game \u2014 it\u2019s a story about desire, tenderness, and a touch of forbidden passion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097130/extras/e3b9bae2c16e29a091796118db43541e.poster.avif?t=1760673403\" width=640 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097130/extras/e3b9bae2c16e29a091796118db43541e.webm?t=1760673403\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097130/extras/e3b9bae2c16e29a091796118db43541e.mp4?t=1760673403\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet <strong>Haruko</strong> \u2014 a young, beautiful, and confident woman who works as a receptionist in a luxurious hotel.<br>She greets every guest with a smile that\u2019s impossible to ignore and a gaze that promises more than simple courtesy. For her, work is not just a duty \u2014 it\u2019s a way to express her sensuality, playfulness, and craving for attention.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>30 unique artworks</strong> \u2014 discover every side of Haruko\u2019s allure, from gentle to seductive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>30 achievements</strong> that unveil all facets of her charm.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gallery mode</strong>, where you can view every unlocked illustration without limits \u2014 slowly, with pleasure, savoring each frame.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Three Difficulty Levels:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Easy</i> \u2014 8 pieces, perfect for relaxing and enjoying the art.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Normal</i> \u2014 32 pieces, where the real challenge begins.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Hard</i> \u2014 200 pieces, for those who crave total immersion in art and temptation.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game was created to offer not only aesthetic satisfaction but also a pleasant challenge for your mind.<br>Feel every piece fall into place \u2014 as tension and curiosity rise with each completed image.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4097130?t=1760673403","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4097130?t=1760673403","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097130/5ec6a668ffa6b01f3d4aefa242f3c5c2dbf83cdd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760673403","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097130/5ec6a668ffa6b01f3d4aefa242f3c5c2dbf83cdd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760673403","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,3,4,5],"notes":"This game is for adults only. It contains adult content including frequent nudity and explicit sexual scenes/scenarios.\r\nA large section of the gallery contains images of nudity, including visible panties, bare legs, buttocks, breasts, vaginas, and cocks. The game includes:\r\n- Depictions of sexual acts including oral, vaginal, and anal sex.\r\n- Fully nude characters with visible genitalia.\r\n- All characters are depicted as adults aged 18 or older."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to a world where temptation lives between the lines of art.<br><strong>Hentai Haruko</strong> is not just a puzzle game \u2014 it\u2019s a story about desire, tenderness, and a touch of forbi